        "action_date": "2025-03-14",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p>This bill requires states to incorporate into their career services programs (1) information about entrepreneurship, and (2) referrals to microenterprise services. It also requires the Department of Labor to conduct a multistate study of entrepreneurial skills development programs, including a review of successful practices for developing such skills.</p>",
